    "title": "Westminster names street after Charlie Kirk - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Karla Rendon ,\n22 hours ago A street in Westminster has been dedicated to the late conservative podcaster and activist Charlie Kirk, who was fatally shot last year. “Charlie Kirk Way” can now be seen in the Orange County city near the intersection of Westminster Boulevard and All-American Way. According to Mayor Charlie Nguyen, it’s the first city in the country to do so. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
